          "en": "Repeated attacks exploit Black Flame for accuracy, damage and penetration. The area finisher is once per battle; startup still needs gear and accuracy support against enemy defense and armor.",
          "zh": "黑焰后的命中、增伤和穿透适合连续打同一目标；范围宝具每战一次，起步仍需装备与命中支援，不能忽略敌方近防和护甲。"
