          "en": "Teleporting beside a target and free sword follow-ups improve tempo. Mitigation and the first-kill heal do not repair armor, so deep entry needs protection.",
          "zh": "合法目标旁瞬移、范围控制与免费追击提升节奏；减伤与首次击杀回血不能修甲，深入敌阵需要防具与队友接应。"
