              "description": "Start with 5/6 scales and 1/3 prestige; regain 2 scales on subsequent normal turns. Paid scale consumption grants equal prestige, except Golden Dragon. The first such action each round echoes after resolving: up to 3 enemies within 1 tile of the cast target position take 25 + 25% of current Resolve damage, +20 ranged accuracy, 150% armor damage, 35% penetration. No recursion. Resolve scaling is capped at 150 current Resolve.",
