      "id": "seven_shields_lower",
      "name": {
        "en": "War against the Seven Shields: Part II",
        "zh": "七盾同盟攻伐战 下篇"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The Third Fortress ledger traces the withheld bounty to the Alliance court. Cross Maia's mercenary line at Fortress Four and Luu Luu's clan defenses at Five, defeat Claudia's Dawn Knights, and demand a final answer at Fortress Seven.",
        "zh": "第三要塞的账簿将欠饷令指向同盟中枢。越过第四要塞的佣兵防线、第五要塞的族人壁垒，击败克劳迪娅的黎明骑士团，向第七要塞索取最后的答复。"
      },
