      "ending": {
        "en": "Fortress Seven accepts the armistice and the overdue bounty is paid. Maia, Luu Luu, Claudia and Celestine sign service contracts. The Alliance retains its towns and civil administration, but can no longer discard the debt owed for the company's blood.",
        "zh": "第七要塞停战，欠饷得以清偿。玛雅、露露、克劳迪娅与塞蕾斯汀签下同行契约。七盾同盟保留城镇与民政，却不再能把佣兵的血债当成一张废纸。"
      },
