          "description": "Reduces health and armor damage from attacks by 35%, or 60% for the first hit in each global round. Holding a shield grants +10 melee and ranged defense and halves native Shieldwall fatigue cost. Shu uses the highest of her defensive reductions instead of multiplying them.",
