        "summary": {
          "en": "An early healing defender and reserve granary with little gear investment.",
          "zh": "前期奶盾与后备粮仓，低装备投入即可守住阵线。"
        },
        "analysis": {
          "en": "Recruited at level 1 with an ordinary wooden shield and militia spear. High starting health and defense combine with fixed mitigation; healing is independent of weapons. Evergreen sustains adjacent defenders, Nurture reaches distant wounded allies, and Granary Guardian answers focus fire. Bountiful Harvest works in reserve and supplies about 50 daily portions based on actual consumption. Movement, displacement or death changes field coverage; healing cannot revive and shields and armor remain valuable. Source-based rating, pending in-game balance review.",
          "zh": "1级入队、自带普通木盾与民兵矛，高生命和基础防御配合固定减伤，治疗不依赖武器。禾生支撑邻接前排，嘉禾照顾远处伤员，丰壤之守应对集火。丰穰在后备也生效，按实际消耗提供至少约50人每日口粮。移动、击退或死亡会改变领域位置和覆盖；治疗不能复活，盾与护甲仍有价值。评级按源码设计，待实机平衡验收。"
        },
        "reviewedSkills": [
          "shu_thick_earth",
          "shu_evergreen",
          "shu_bountiful_harvest",
          "shu_nurture",
          "shu_granary"
        ],
